Comment:
 ForkTTY release packages include the ForkTTY application plus vendored
 Ghostty runtime artifacts pinned in the source tree. Complete corresponding
 source is available from the upstream repository and its submodules:
 `git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/Lucenx9/forktty.git`.
